{"task_id": "Mbpp/65", "solution": "def recursive_list_sum(input_list: list) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a given nested list and calculates the sum of all numerical elements within it.\n    It recursively traverses the list, summing numbers and further flattening nested lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for element in input_list:\n        if isinstance(element, list):\n            total_sum += recursive_list_sum(element)\n        elif isinstance(element, (int, float)):\n            total_sum += element\n    return total_sum"}
