{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {1: 1, 2: 1} # Stores computed Newman-Conway numbers for memoization.\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    The sequence is defined by P(1)=1, P(2)=1, and P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    # Calculate P(n) using the recursive formula.\n    val = sequence(sequence(n - 1)) + sequence(n - sequence(n - 1))\n    _memo[n] = val\n    return val"}
