{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def _find_divisors(num: int) -> set[int]:\n    \"\"\"Helper function to find all divisors of a positive integer.\"\"\"\n    divs = set()\n    for i in range(1, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n        if num % i == 0:\n            divs.add(i)\n            divs.add(num // i)\n    return divs\n\ndef sum(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of common divisors for two positive integers.\"\"\"\n    divisors1 = _find_divisors(num1)\n    divisors2 = _find_divisors(num2)\n\n    common_divisors = divisors1.intersection(divisors2)\n\n    return builtins.sum(common_divisors)"}
