{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(source_string: str, target_substring: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of non-overlapping, case-sensitive occurrences of target_substring in source_string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not target_substring:\n        return 0\n\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    while True:\n        found_index = source_string.find(target_substring, start_index)\n        if found_index != -1:\n            count += 1\n            start_index = found_index + len(target_substring)\n        else:\n            break\n    return count"}
