{"task_id": "Mbpp/244", "solution": "import math\n\ndef next_Perfect_Square(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the smallest perfect square strictly greater than the given number.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Calculate the integer part of the square root of the number.\n    # The next perfect square will be (root + 1)^2.\n    root = int(math.sqrt(number))\n    next_root = root + 1\n    \n    # Square the next integer root to get the next perfect square.\n    next_square = next_root * next_root\n    \n    return next_square"}
