{"task_id": "Mbpp/245", "solution": "def _calculate_lis_sums(arr: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum sum of an increasing subsequence ending at each index.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n    lis_sums = list(arr)\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                lis_sums[i] = max(lis_sums[i], lis_sums[j] + arr[i])\n    return lis_sums\n\ndef _calculate_lds_sums(arr: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum sum of a decreasing subsequence starting at each index.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n    lds_sums = list(arr)\n    for i in range(n - 2, -1, -1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                lds_sums[i] = max(lds_sums[i], lds_sums[j] + arr[i])\n    return lds_sums\n\ndef max_sum(arr: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum sum of a bitonic subsequence for the given array.\n\n    Returns 0 for an empty array.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    lis_sums = _calculate_lis_sums(arr)\n    lds_sums = _calculate_lds_sums(arr)\n\n    max_bitonic_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        # A bitonic subsequence with arr[i] as peak has sum LIS ending at i + LDS starting at i - arr[i]\n        # (arr[i] is counted twice).\n        current_bitonic_sum = lis_sums[i] + lds_sums[i] - arr[i]\n        max_bitonic_sum = max(max_bitonic_sum, current_bitonic_sum)\n\n    return max_bitonic_sum"}
