{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    Args:\n        n (int): The number of first odd natural numbers to consider.\n    Returns:\n        int: The sum of their squares.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        odd_number = 2 * i + 1  # First odd natural number is 1 (i=0), second is 3 (i=1), etc.\n        total_sum += odd_number ** 2\n    return total_sum"}
