{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers, each raised to the fifth power.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        current_even_number = 2 * i\n        powered_value = current_even_number ** 5\n        total_sum += powered_value\n    return total_sum"}
