{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "import collections\n\ndef validate(integer_value: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks whether the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    Returns True if the frequency of each digit is <= the digit's value, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if integer_value < 0:\n        integer_value = abs(integer_value)\n\n    if integer_value == 0:\n        return False\n\n    s_integer = str(integer_value)\n    digit_frequencies = collections.Counter(s_integer)\n\n    for digit_char, frequency in digit_frequencies.items():\n        digit = int(digit_char)\n        if digit == 0:\n            if frequency > 0: # The digit '0' cannot appear (frequency must be 0) for 0 <= 0 to be true\n                return False\n        elif frequency > digit:\n            return False\n    return True"}
