{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of elements in two nested tuples.\n    Returns a new tuple of tuples with the product of corresponding elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_outer_tuple = []\n    for inner_t1, inner_t2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        result_inner_tuple = []\n        for e1, e2 in zip(inner_t1, inner_t2):\n            result_inner_tuple.append(e1 * e2)\n        result_outer_tuple.append(tuple(result_inner_tuple))\n    return tuple(result_outer_tuple)"}
