{"task_id": "Mbpp/564", "solution": "def count_Pairs(input_list: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of possible unordered pairs from the input list\n    where both elements are unequal.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    if n < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if input_list[i] != input_list[j]:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
