{"task_id": "Mbpp/615", "solution": "def average_tuple(data: tuple[tuple[int | float, ...], ...]) -> list[float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average value for each inner tuple within a tuple of tuples.\n    Returns a list of float values, where each value is the average of an inner tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    averages = []\n    for inner_tuple in data:\n        current_sum = sum(inner_tuple)\n        count = len(inner_tuple)\n        average = current_sum / count\n        averages.append(average)\n    return averages"}
