{"task_id": "Mbpp/730", "solution": "def consecutive_duplicates(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes consecutive duplicate elements from the input list.\n    Returns a new list with consecutive duplicates removed.\n    \"\"\"\n    output_list = []\n    if not input_list:\n        return output_list\n\n    output_list.append(input_list[0])\n\n    for i in range(1, len(input_list)):\n        if input_list[i] != input_list[i-1]:\n            output_list.append(input_list[i])\n\n    return output_list"}
