{"task_id": "Mbpp/740", "solution": "def tuple_to_dict(input_tuple: tuple) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a tuple to a key-value dictionary using adjacent elements.\n    The element at index 2n becomes a key, and 2n+1 becomes its value.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_tuple, tuple):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a tuple.\")\n\n    result_dict = {}\n    for i in range(0, len(input_tuple) - 1, 2):\n        key = input_tuple[i]\n        value = input_tuple[i+1]\n        result_dict[key] = value\n    return result_dict"}
