{"task_id": "Mbpp/758", "solution": "from collections import Counter\nfrom typing import Any, List, Dict, Tuple\n\ndef unique_sublists(input_list: List[List[Any]]) -> Dict[Tuple[Any, ...], int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the occurrences of unique sublists within a given list, returning them as a dictionary.\n    Each sublist is converted to a tuple to be used as a dictionary key.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts = Counter()\n    for sublist in input_list:\n        counts[tuple(sublist)] += 1\n    return dict(counts)"}
